# A policy lookup that throws or is cancelled admits the entry unjudged.
MODULE: StoredValidWhenJudgedTrustsFailedLookup
TARGET: StoredValidWhenJudged
CLASS: Invariant
SUMMARY: a failed policy lookup proceeds to the commit
PERTURBS: Judge

--- FIND
       ELSE /\ rphase' = "Failed"
            /\ UNCHANGED judged
--- REPLACE
       ELSE /\ rphase' = "Committing"
            /\ UNCHANGED judged
--- END